   "text": "California Lutheran University (Postgraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCalifornia Lutheran University (Postgraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nCalifornia Lutheran University is a selective, comprehensive institution offering graduate and professional programs through the College of Arts and Sciences, School of Management, Graduate School of Psychology, School for Professional and Continuing Studies, and Pacific Lutheran Theological Seminary. Mentored by dedicated and accomplished faculty members, students pursue their passion and discover their purpose as they seek to grow as individuals.\nCalifornia Lutheran College was founded in 1959 on a ranch donated by Richard Pederson, the son of Norwegian immigrants. The college opened its doors to 330 students in September 1961 and held its first Commencement in May 1964.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:42\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:42\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$40,000.00\nMin: US$30,615.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n9%\n104 of 1,223 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1959\nCampus(es)\nThousand Oaks, California\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/03/2023\nContract End Date\n17/03/2028\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6YQKMJuFk9Q\nInternship Details\nInternship available\nAdditional Information\n-",
